1
00:00:00.087 --> 00:00:14.511
<00:00:00.087>On <00:00:00.217>April <00:00:01.037>19, <00:00:01.528>2021, <00:00:02.348>I <00:00:02.402>spun <00:00:02.663>up, <00:00:03.109>lifted <00:00:03.467>3 <00:00:03.728>metres <00:00:04.076>off <00:00:04.250>the <00:00:04.337>ground, <00:00:05.065>hovered, <00:00:05.630>and <00:00:05.717>came <00:00:05.924>back <00:00:06.163>down. <00:00:06.826>Thirty-nine <00:00:07.217>seconds. <00:00:08.098>Under <00:00:08.261>my <00:00:08.391>solar <00:00:08.728>panel <00:00:09.196>I <00:00:09.283>carry <00:00:09.587>a <00:00:09.641>scrap <00:00:09.978>of <00:00:10.076>cloth <00:00:10.413>from <00:00:10.554>the <00:00:10.630>Wright <00:00:10.880>brothers' <00:00:11.315>first <00:00:11.663>aeroplane. <00:00:12.489>First <00:00:12.696>flight <00:00:12.902>on <00:00:13.033>Earth, <00:00:13.511>first <00:00:13.772>flight <00:00:13.978>on <00:00:14.087>Mars.

