<00:00:14.870>I <00:00:14.935>was <00:00:15.054>supposed <00:00:15.359>to <00:00:15.413>fly <00:00:15.652>five <00:00:15.946>times <00:00:16.185>at <00:00:16.261>most. <00:00:17.043>I <00:00:17.130>flew <00:00:17.359>72 <00:00:17.859>times. <00:00:18.696>I <00:00:18.772>flew <00:00:19.054>higher, <00:00:19.641>faster <00:00:20.098>and <00:00:20.174>farther, <00:00:20.978>and <00:00:21.043>I <00:00:21.109>became <00:00:21.424>a <00:00:21.478>scout <00:00:21.783>for <00:00:21.902>my <00:00:22.043>rover, <00:00:22.707>looking <00:00:22.967>over <00:00:23.098>the <00:00:23.174>next <00:00:23.435>hill. <00:00:24.033>I <00:00:24.109>got <00:00:24.283>through <00:00:24.435>a <00:00:24.478>Martian <00:00:24.880>winter <00:00:25.435>and <00:00:25.500>more <00:00:25.739>than <00:00:25.880>one <00:00:26.087>rough <00:00:26.293>landing.
